{"id":"6814945c0da707f8","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-zfc-prewellordering.md","title":"ZFC Prewellordering","display":"df-zfc-prewellordering — ZFC Prewellordering","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-prewellordering","aliases":["58-df-zfc-prewellordering"],"display":"df-zfc-prewellordering — ZFC Prewellordering","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-order6-preorder.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-prewellordering"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-prewellordering</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-prewellordering — ZFC Prewellordering"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e0308c920cba2bdd\" href=\"?note=e0308c920cba2bdd\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-zfc-order6-preorder.md\">../batch13/58-df-zfc-order6-preorder.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,R,\\rho,\\alpha\\in V\">\\(A,R,\\rho,\\alpha\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Preorder},\\mathrm{Function},\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\operatorname{Preorder},\\mathrm{Function},\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> (predicates from dependencies)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prewellordering}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Prewellordering}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prewellordering}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Prewellordering}_S(R,A)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\nR\\subseteq A\\times A\n\\land\\operatorname{Preorder}(A,R)\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in A\\;\n\\left(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\lor\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in R\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\exists\\alpha\\;\\exists\\rho\\;\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\rho,A,\\alpha)\n\\land\n\\forall x,y\\in A\\;\n\\left(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\leftrightarrow\\rho(x)\\subseteq\\rho(y)\\right)\n\\right].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prewellordering}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Prewellordering}_S(R,A)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\nR\\subseteq A\\times A\n\\land\\operatorname{Preorder}(A,R)\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in A\\;\n\\left(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\lor\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in R\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\exists\\alpha\\;\\exists\\rho\\;\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\rho,A,\\alpha)\n\\land\n\\forall x,y\\in A\\;\n\\left(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\leftrightarrow\\rho(x)\\subseteq\\rho(y)\\right)\n\\right].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The ordinal-valued rank witnesses well-foundedness of the quotient and\navoids applying well-foundedness directly to an undefined quotient relation.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-zfc-order6-preorder.md","status":"resolved","id":"e0308c920cba2bdd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-order6-preorder.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,R,\\rho,\\alpha\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Preorder},\\mathrm{Function},\\mathrm{Ordinal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prewellordering}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prewellordering}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Prewellordering}_S(R,A)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\nR\\subseteq A\\times A\n\\land\\operatorname{Preorder}(A,R)\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in A\\;\n\\left(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\lor\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in R\\right)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\n\\exists\\alpha\\;\\exists\\rho\\;\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\rho,A,\\alpha)\n\\land\n\\forall x,y\\in A\\;\n\\left(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\leftrightarrow\\rho(x)\\subseteq\\rho(y)\\right)\n\\right].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1308,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3136","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-prewellordering.md|58-df-zfc-prewellordering]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","e0308c920cba2bdd","36d7463d215be751","5582a281f15a33c2"]}